  "description": "Screening Opinion for demolition of the existing Hounslow Town Primary School (as shown in Appendix 1) and the development of a replacement primary school on the western half of the Site (Appendix 2) and up to 310 residential units on the eastern half of the Site (Appendix 3). The residential site extends to circa 1.17ha and Phase 1 including 50 residential units will be built by March 2018 at the same time as the school. Phase 2 of the residential development and up to a further 260 residential units will commence in autumn 2018 with the remainder of units completed by March 2020."
